<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="bingle-version" content="{{engineVersion}}">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
	<title>Bingle — Administration</title>
	<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/static/favicon.svg" id="favicon">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
</head>
<body>
	<header class="topbar">
		<a class="brand" href="/"><span class="logo"></span>Bingle</a>
		<span class="spacer"></span>
	</header>
	<main class="page narrow">
		<h1>Administration</h1>
		<p class="small error" id="admin-refused" hidden></p>
		<p class="small" id="admin-second-factor" hidden><a class="button primary" href="/account#tf-box">Set up a second factor</a></p>
		<section class="card" id="caps-card" hidden>
			<h2>Who may do what</h2>
			<p class="small" id="caps-mode"></p>
			<p class="small" id="caps-drift" hidden>The database has drifted from the capabilities file. <code>bingle caps reset</code> applies the file again.</p>
			<div class="admin-scroll">
				<table class="admin-table caps" id="caps-table">
					<thead><tr><th scope="col">Capability</th><th scope="col" class="col-check">Users</th><th scope="col" class="col-check">Guests</th></tr></thead>
					<tbody id="caps-rows"></tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
			<p class="small muted">Administrators may do everything. A change applies to whatever is started from now on; a call already up is not cut off.</p>
			<h3>Limits per minute</h3>
			<div class="admin-scroll">
				<table class="admin-table limits">
					<thead><tr><th scope="col">What</th><th scope="col" class="num">Users</th><th scope="col" class="num">Guests</th></tr></thead>
					<tbody id="caps-limits"></tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
			<p class="small" id="caps-result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
		</section>
		<section class="card" id="events-card" hidden>
			<h2>What happened</h2>
			<p class="small muted">Sign-ins and their failures, sign-ups, changes to passwords, second factors, tokens and permissions: the latest 200.</p>
			<div class="admin-scroll">
				<table class="admin-table events" id="events-table">
					<thead><tr><th scope="col">When</th><th scope="col">Account</th><th scope="col">What</th><th scope="col">Detail</th></tr></thead>
					<tbody id="events-rows"></tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="card" id="invite-card" hidden>
			<h2>Invitations</h2>
			<p class="small" id="invite-state"></p>
			<div class="row"><button type="button" class="primary" id="invite-go">Make an invitation</button></div>
			<p class="small" id="invite-link"></p>
		</section>
	</main>
	<footer class="site-footer"><sub title="The version of the bingle engine">bingle v{{engineVersion}} · MIT License · <a href="https://github.com/noderunner/bingle" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></sub></footer>
	<script type="module" src="/static/js/errors.js"></script>
	<script type="module" src="/static/js/admin.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
